@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance ss 46B and 46C. Row IL-27. Source lines 1756-1761.
--
-- s 46B: "the amount of tax of which a person was relieved by the credit for donations under s 46 and under any other law shall be added to the
-- amount of tax that is the base for fixing advance payments under s 175". The base before this addition and the tax relieved are
-- inputs; s 175 (advance payments) is in the Ordinance and is not encoded here (the row names only this addition).
-- The consolidation's note on s 46B (line 1758, commemorating a fallen soldier) summarises s 4 of the Amendment (No. 2) Law of 5722-1962,
-- which is not in the source bundle: out of scope. s 46C is repealed ("בוטל", line 1761): inert.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Sections 46B and 46C — the base for advance payments`

-- src:1757 | סכום המס שאדם הופטר מתשלומו בשל הזיכוי בעד תרומות לפי סעיף 46 ולפי כל דין אחר, ייווסף לסכום המס המהווה בסיס לקביעת מקדמות על פי סעיף 175.
-- src:1761 | [note: (בוטל).]

@export The tax that forms the base for fixing advance payments under Income Tax Ordinance s 175 after the addition of s 46B: the base before the addition plus the tax the person was relieved of by the credit for donations under s 46 and under any other law, for a tax year from 2024
@ref ITO s 46B, line 1757
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
      `the base before the addition` IS A NUMBER
          @desc NIS; the tax that is the base for advance payments under s 175 before s 46B's addition
      `the tax relieved by credit for donations` IS A NUMBER
          @desc NIS; the tax of which the person was relieved by the credit under s 46 and under any other law
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the base for advance payments after section 46B in tax year` `the tax year` `, the base before the addition being` `the base before the addition` `and the tax relieved by credit for donations` `the tax relieved by credit for donations` MEANS
    `for tax year` `the tax year` `, row IL-27 answers` (`the base before the addition` PLUS `the tax relieved by credit for donations`)
